1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:01,760
(Penny's dad (Wyatt):)that knows how to use a napkin.

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:05,030
(Penny:)So not funny, Dad.

3
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:07,430
(Wyatt:)Let me tell you about this one
genius she was going out with,

4
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:08,970
this-this
fella Donnie.

5
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:10,540
(Penny:)Oh, will you please let it go?

6
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:12,500
(Wyatt:)Donnie was gonna make millions
turning farm waste

7
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,610
(Wyatt:)into biofuel and selling it
to the government.

8
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:16,310
(Leonard:)A lot of people are doing that.

9
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:17,740
(Penny:)Oh, see?

10
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:20,030
(Wyatt:)Yeah, but all Donnie did was mix
pig poop with a little water

11
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,380
(Wyatt:)and pump it
into his mom's Camry.

12
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:24,680
(Penny:)Yeah, that's great.

13
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,250
(Penny:)It's a funny story. Moving on.

14
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:28,550
(Wyatt:)And Donnie was a rocket
scientist compared to that boy

15
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:30,660
(Wyatt:)who wanted to get beer pong
into the Olympics.

16
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:31,790
(Wyatt:)What was his
name, sweetheart?

17
00:00:31,790 --> 00:00:34,260
(Penny:)Curtis, and I'm pretty sure
he was joking.

18
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,190
(Wyatt:)I don't know.

19
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:36,590
(Wyatt:)That petition
looked real to me.

20
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,400
(Penny:)Yeah, okay, I think this ends

21
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,170
(Penny:)the ex-boyfriend portion
of our evening.

22
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:44,250
(Wyatt:)Well, I'm just glad you finally
found yourself a keeper.

23
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:45,570
(Leonard:)Thanks, Wyatt.

24
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:47,940
(Leonard:)I'm a keeper.

25
00:00:52,610 --> 00:00:54,480
(Wyatt:)Leonard, you want to come in
for a nightcap?

26
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:55,710
(Penny:)Oh, gee, Dad,
he'd love to,

27
00:00:55,710 --> 00:00:57,150
(Penny:)but Leonard has to work
in the morning.

28
00:00:57,150 --> 00:00:59,150
(Leonard:)Maybe I could
go in a little late.

29
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,450
(Penny:)No, no, no, you can't.

